resolution: "Implemented and merged in https://github.com/unbraind/pm-brief/pull/144: SDK installation metadata contract validated so Dependabot toolchain bumps stay green"
expected_result: The acceptance criteria recorded on pm-brief-m8hh are met on main.
actual_result: "Merged in https://github.com/unbraind/pm-brief/pull/144 after its full CI, an isolated release gate and a CodeRabbit full review with every finding resolved; SDK installation metadata contract validated so Dependabot toolchain bumps stay green"
comments[28]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-04T10:37:42.117Z",pi-cert-a,"Gate evidence: npm run release:check green 339/339 (typecheck, release-workflow, build, docstring, coverage, audit:prod 0 vulnerabilities, pack:dry-run, accept:packed, changelog:check with pm-changelog 2026.10.4, publish-attestation ok); ./node_modules/.bin/pm health --strict-exit exits 0; npm audit and npm audit --omit=dev both clean. Launcher re-copied byte-identical from pm-ops@2026.10.4 templates (fail-closed probe on unreadable lookup paths). REQUIRED_DEVELOPMENT_VERSION in test/version-contract.ts raised to 2026.10.4.\n\nDogfood (pm-brief-2026.9.26.tgz packed from this tree, installed into a scratch copy of this repo's real tracker):\n- npm: 'npx -y @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 brief' rendered the full brief (79 items, budget respected); 'brief next --explain --count 2' ranked pm-brief-4ohy (score 222) and this item pm-brief-m8hh (score 115) with evidence lines.\n- bun: 'bunx --bun @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 brief prompt' rendered the agent handoff prompt (score 247 top item); 'brief stale' listed 5 stale items.\nScratch copy deleted afterwards.\n\npm-github: installed as managed extension pm-github@2026.10.4; read-only preview 'pm github sync --repo unbraind/pm-brief --dry-run' -> 'No pm items linked to unbraind/pm-brief' planned 0. No issues created/modified, no scheduled sync."
  "2026-10-04T10:40:30.580Z",pi-cert-a,"pm test --run receipt: the linked 'npm run release:check' fails only inside the pm test harness — scripts/accept-packed.ts's throwaway 'npx pm init --defaults --prefix accept' in /tmp/pm-brief-packed-accept exits status 2 ('No tracker exists') because the harness injects the sandbox PM_PATH into the linked command's process tree (same upstream defect class as unbraind/pm-cli#1391, already filed with the pm-ops reproduction). The direct release:check — exactly what CI runs — is green 339/339. Every pm-ops-covered repo with a packed-accept step that initializes a scratch tracker hits this under the harness."
  "2026-10-04T10:52:31.841Z",codex-sol,"Resume from pushed PR #133. Greptile thread 4177156759 is valid: add package-without-manifest, dangling-link and deterministic ENOTDIR lookup fixtures, assert the original installer resolution error and no registered drivers. Keep the copied launcher byte-identical to published pm-ops 2026.10.4. Copy the current Dependabot #128 CodeQL SHA, exact-pin development dependencies, then repeat the full gate and real-tracker packed acceptance."
  "2026-10-04T10:57:15.594Z",codex-sol,"Test-first evidence for Greptile 4177156759: 9/9 launcher tests pass with zero skipped. The ENOTDIR negative control fails against origin/main launcher; canonical pm-ops 2026.10.4 restores a green run. Fixtures assert Cannot find module pm-ops/merge-driver/prepare, forbid the skip notice and replacement ENOTDIR diagnostic, and assert zero registered drivers."
  "2026-10-04T11:13:20.222Z",codex-sol,"Full restart gate: flock /tmp/claude-1000/heavy-gate.lock npm run release:check passed 342/342 tests, zero skipped, all packed acceptance scenarios (npm-current, bun-current, npm-minimum) passed. V8 report: 100% lines / 97.84% branches / 100% functions; the existing coverage gate passes without any threshold or tolerance edits. Both npm audits zero vulnerabilities and npx pm health --strict-exit --require-merge-drivers passes. The PM-linked launcher suite also passes 9/9. Packed real-tracker dogfood: npm pack --silent, install tarball with @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 into pm-brief-dogfood, package install <tarball> --project copy.complete=true; both npx -y @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 and bunx --bun -y @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 execute brief, brief next --explain --count 2, brief prompt and brief stale against 79 actual tracker items. Outputs include ranked evidence, rendered prompts and 5 stale items. Scratch deleted. Read-only github sync preview planned=0/synced=0. Greptile 4177156759 is addressed by the three new behavior fixtures; one exact current CodeQL SHA copied from Dependabot #128. The existing coverage improvement item pm-brief-gtiy remains open."
  "2026-10-04T11:36:17.437Z",codex-sol,"Orchestrator handoff for PR #133: source head 686689baf3cb8a9a0fb113ad6eb596e3ffd52a6c has green Node 22/26 and CodeQL CI; local release/health/audit/dogfood receipts are recorded above. Greptile 4177156759 fixed in 686689b; thread resolved, subsequent reviews found no new issue. Zero unresolved review threads. Required review quorum is unavailable: Sourcery weekly quota; Cubic monthly quota/skip; Gemini and Copilot have no response after the requested review round. Configured coverage reports 97.84% branches and does not separately measure statements; pm-brief-gtiy remains open. All bot comments/reviews/inline findings inspected; useful findings/summaries reacted positively, skip/quota notices negatively, concrete replies posted, addressed threads resolved. Initial review requests sent once per repo; pm-ops received one second-round request after its valid fix. No merge, close, auto-merge, publication or release. Release the claim for orchestrator verification; the certification item remains in progress. Final metadata head will be checked separately before removing the worktree."
  "2026-10-10T03:58:18.377Z",codex-sol,"Test-first reproduction: installing published SDK2026.10.9 makes the prior compatibility suite fail actual9 vs hardcoded4. The repaired contract resolves the installed public package.json and validates its exact release identity, preserving the8.20 compatibility floor. Focused suite passes; full release and packed consumers running."
  "2026-10-10T04:43:04.309Z",codex-sol,Final latest-SDK gate passes367 tests and all3 packed consumers. TDD and manifest-only negative control prove the contract rejects a valid but uninstalled version. Source floor unchanged. Companion session pm-cli-website-session-2026-10-10 links this repair and the remaining whole-source coverage/review boundaries.
  "2026-10-11T05:00:19.412Z",codex-sol,"Continuing automated toolchain upgrade assurance after the installed SDK metadata repair. Inspecting actual dependency PR manifests and preserving exact development pins, minimum host floors, lockfile root/resolution consistency, installed metadata consistency, and all prepare installer safety contracts. Full downloaded CI log and PR 141 checks confirm the historical approved-version failure."
  "2026-10-11T05:03:19.626Z",codex-sol,"Design: exact pins for all three toolchain packages must match package-lock root specifications, locked node_modules versions, and independently resolved installed package metadata. The historical minimum runtime remains a capability floor. Prepare safety is enforced by real checkout behavior, including missing CLI, instead of template byte equality. Metadata regressions exercise coherent future updates plus range, root-lock, resolution-lock, missing-resolution, and installed-skew failures for each package."
  "2026-10-11T05:05:53.770Z",codex-sol,"Revert proof: focused contracts pass 34/34 with zero skips. Reverting only assertToolchainPins to the previous CLI-only exact-pin/installed check leaves new tests unchanged and produces 13 failures of 16; restoring the checker passes 16/16. These failures are assertion failures for missing inconsistency rejection, not import/build failures. Tests execute TypeScript directly, so no stale dist exists in this proof. Raw focused, reverted, and restored logs retained externally."
  "2026-10-11T05:06:42.337Z",codex-agent,"Orchestrator review: current main already binds the CLI development version to installed metadata. The remaining toolchain consistency checks and behavioral prepare contract are being verified against the dependency PR manifests, with unchanged compatibility floors and coverage thresholds."
  "2026-10-11T05:11:05.214Z",codex-sol,"PM-linked focused test run passes 34/34 with zero skips using the default schema context and --match toolchain-contract --progress. Result tracking is disabled by repository policy, so this comment records the observed execution receipt without changing policy. Earlier context-option attempts were rejected before test execution; no SDK defect or upstream issue was filed."
  "2026-10-11T05:38:44.956Z",codex-sol,"The full npm release gate is running with a disposable HOME and both global and system Git configuration disabled. Real tracker governance, author filtering, merge-receipt collection/display, truncation, clean/corrupt receipt stores, and output-format integration scenarios have passed so far. README now describes behavior without numeric toolchain-version annotations. Bun validation will use the required full script and existing Bun/bunx packed consumers; this is not a claim that every test runs natively under Bun."
  "2026-10-11T05:44:00.028Z",codex-sol,"The isolated-Git-config npm release gate has passed 384/384 tests with zero failures or skips. V8 reports one runtime source file with lines 100%, branches 97.96%, functions 100%; configured thresholds remain 100/97.85/100. Documentation gate passes 107 declarations across 7 files; production audit reports zero vulnerabilities and dry-run packing succeeds. Packed consumer acceptance is still running; this is not yet a full-gate completion receipt."
  "2026-10-11T05:56:36.443Z",codex-sol,"Original manifests full npm release:check passes under a fresh HOME with global and system Git configuration disabled: 384/384 tests, zero skipped; coverage 100/97.96/100 across one runtime file; docstrings 107 declarations across 7 files; production audit zero; all 3 packed npm-current, Bun-current, and npm-minimum consumers pass with fixture present, zero stderr, bounded estimate 163 and cannot-fit exit 2. Changelog and the single provenance-attested publish invocation pass. Full Bun gate on unchanged original manifests is next."
  "2026-10-11T06:16:16.426Z",codex-sol,"The unchanged-original-manifest Bun release gate remains in progress. Real Git divergence, governance, author filtering, merge-receipt unit checks, and the real pending-receipt collection scenario have passed so far. No implementation, dependency, floor, or threshold changes have been made since the focused regression proof. Both full gates on the actual dependency-update manifest pair are still required before commit and PR."
  "2026-10-11T06:16:42.007Z",codex-agent,"Orchestrator verification: the metadata contract tests independently pass 16/16, including coherent future updates and drift rejection. Preserved the README benchmark SDK identity and historical feature introduction versions; those describe provenance and compatibility rather than duplicate current development pins."
  "2026-10-11T06:33:16.251Z",codex-sol,"Original manifests full Bun release gate has passed 384/384 tests with zero failures or skips and unchanged 100/97.96/100 V8 coverage across one runtime source file. Docstrings pass 107 declarations across 7 files, production audit reports zero vulnerabilities, and dry-run packing succeeds. Packed acceptance remains in progress, so the full Bun completion receipt is still pending."
  "2026-10-11T06:36:57.094Z",codex-sol,"Removed remaining historical numeric toolchain annotations from README.md while retaining behavior and marking the performance receipt historical. Development pins remain in package metadata, and compatibility floors remain separate minimum requirements. Runtime checker and installer code are unchanged since the passing focused and npm gates."
  "2026-10-11T06:39:40.904Z",codex-sol,"Original-manifest bun run release:check passed completely: 384 tests passed, zero failures or skips; configured coverage 100% lines, 97.96% branches, 100% functions across one runtime source file; all 107 declarations in seven gated files documented; zero production vulnerabilities. Packed npm-current and Bun-current on SDK 2026.10.10 and npm-minimum on SDK 2026.8.20 each passed real tracker, clean stderr, bounded output and usage-exit checks. Changelog and publication attestation passed. Bun receipt covers the script runner and bunx launcher; it does not claim native Bun SDK execution. Next: temporarily install the exact automated update manifests and run both complete gates without any test or threshold edits."
  "2026-10-11T06:41:10.010Z",codex-agent,"Orchestrator review requirement: retain the README historical benchmark SDK identity and feature introduction versions restored here. They do not participate in approved-development-pin assertions. Removing the benchmark host identity loses measurement provenance and is outside the duplication fix. Do not remove those historical numbers again; current development pin consistency is already enforced solely by manifests, lockfile and installed metadata. Preserve this reviewed README when committing."
  "2026-10-11T06:43:17.987Z",codex-sol,"README scope clarification: preserved the historical benchmark SDK and feature introduction versions following orchestrator review. They record provenance and compatibility history rather than approved development pins. Current toolchain pin guidance uses package.json and independent lock/installed checks; prepare guidance no longer requires template byte equality. The preceding numeric-annotation-removal note is superseded by this narrower documentation scope."
  "2026-10-11T07:00:38.381Z",codex-sol,"The actual automated update manifest pair installs cleanly with CLI 2026.10.6, pm-ops 2026.10.6, and pm-changelog 2026.10.5. Its full isolated-Git-config npm gate has passed 384/384 tests, zero failures or skips, unchanged coverage thresholds and zero production vulnerabilities. Packing and packed-consumer acceptance remain in progress; the full gate is not yet complete. No test, floor, or threshold edits were required for this dependency pair."
  "2026-10-11T07:07:09.004Z",codex-sol,"Actual automated update manifests full npm run release:check passed with isolated HOME and disabled global/system Git configuration: 384/384 tests, zero failures/cancellations/skips; coverage 100/97.96/100 across one runtime file; docstrings 107 declarations across seven files; zero production vulnerabilities; dry-run package nine files. All three packed consumers passed with SDK 2026.10.6 current and 2026.8.20 minimum, fixture present, zero stderr, bounded estimate 163, and cannot-fit exit 2. Changelog and the single provenance-attested publish invocation passed. The same installed update pair now runs full bun run release:check."
  "2026-10-11T07:28:40.961Z",codex-sol,"Actual automated update manifest pair full Bun gate has passed 384/384 tests with zero failures or skips, unchanged 100/97.96/100 coverage across one runtime source file, all 107 documentation declarations, zero production vulnerabilities, and nine-file dry-run packaging. Packed acceptance is still running; full completion remains pending. Existing installer safety cases and the installed-package missing-CLI regression all passed without copying a new template."
  "2026-10-11T07:33:10.125Z",codex-sol,"Actual automated update manifests full bun run release:check passed completely: 384/384 tests, zero failures/cancellations/skips; coverage 100/97.96/100 across one runtime source file with thresholds unchanged; 107 documented declarations across seven files; zero production vulnerabilities; nine-file dry-run package; all three packed current/minimum consumers passed with fixture present, zero stderr, bounded estimate 163, and cannot-fit exit 2. Changelog and single provenance-attested publish invocation passed. All four full original/update npm/Bun gates are complete. Restoring the original manifest pair and running npm ci; no dependency upgrade is needed for this repair."
  "2026-10-11T07:35:22.235Z",codex-sol,"Final restoration receipt: package.json and package-lock.json exactly match the starting HEAD; npm ci succeeds with zero vulnerabilities and npm ls --depth=0 succeeds. No dependency upgrade, threshold reduction, SDK mock, runtime-extension change, upstream issue, merge or publication is part of this repair. New TypeScript functions are documented and erasable. Full raw logs remain external. Historical README benchmark/feature versions were retained following orchestrator review; current pin guidance and prepare contract avoid duplicate approved version/template requirements. Releasing the claim for orchestrator verification, leaving the item in progress."
